sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express /api
  participant B as BountyService
  participant U as UserRepo
  participant R as BountyRepo
  participant N as Notifier (Socket.IO)
  actor M as Eligible mentors
  S->>C: Fill "Post a bounty" form
  C->>A: POST /api/bounties (JWT)
  A->>B: createBounty(studentId, input)
  B->>B: validate input
  B->>U: adjustTokens(student, -reward)
  Note right of U: atomic: tokens >= reward
  alt insufficient balance
    U-->>B: null
    B-->>A: 402 Not enough tokens
  else escrowed
    B->>R: create({status: open, expiresAt})
    B->>U: findMentorsBySkills(tags)
    B->>N: toUsers(mentorIds, "bounty:new")
    N-->>M: push bounty:new (real time)
    B-->>A: bounty
    A-->>C: 201 {bounty}
  end
